“It’s been a good time for us to move on to brands, because the basic question (we’re asking ourselves) is how to focus on becoming a better bank for customers?”
Three years ago it would be very cynical if we were to say that we would become a great bank for our customers and introduced those brands.
But along with how we focused on the needs of our customers, and not on our own, I think there are a lot of changes.
