I believe that the most important role of administration is to support your activities of the head of the state within the meaning of draft laws and the control to the extent to which your instructions are adhered.
On Friday, Putin told the Russian television station that Ivanov had asked him to retire from the post and recommended him to be replaced by Vajno.
Convinciate the smiles?
This move completely mystified Moscow.
For a long time, Sergei Ivanov was one of Vladimir Putin’s closest collaborators and, like Putin, worked for the KGB.
As the head of the presidential office, he was one of the most powerful men in the country.
Speaking at a meeting with President Putin aired by state-owned television, the two men said they were releasing from the head of the presidential office at their own request.
Smiles into the CCTV only convinced a few people - especially now, just before the parliamentary elections.
So is it a result of a power struggle?
No one already knows.
