Claude Lanzmann, the author of a documentary film about the "Shoah", ventilated his frustration from the Kempinski Bristol Hotel in Berlin in an open letter to the German newspaper FAZ.
During his recent residency, Lanzmann was attempting to find Israel in a hotel list.
However, the state was not listed among the countries to which it is possible to call directly from the living room.
How is it possible that Israel was eliminated and deleted in Berlin, the capital of Germany in 2016?
Wrote by Lanzmann.
Hotel Kempinski Bristol instead offers the possibility of calling to Israel through its own call center.
The director searched for an explanation and with the problem he contacted the reception of the hotel.
According to him, the answer he had “shocked” Lanzmann.
The operator of the hotel replied that the measure was "determined at the discretion of Kempinski Hotels management."
He irritated the reason for the director’s action even more.
"Most of our guests are the Arabs, and they have demanded Israel's calling code to be erased," Lanzmann was quoted as saying.
Suddeutsche Zeitung, Israel’s ambassador in Germany Yakov Hadas-Handelsman called the case a “greater disgrace.”
We were terrified and shocked by the events.
In itself, it's a huge disgrace.
The fact that something like this took place in Germany and, moreover, in such a hotel chain, is an even greater disgrace.
There is no need for further explanation.
We expect that the hotel will draw the right conclusions," he said.
The event provoked a strong reaction online, people called it scandalous.
Some believe the Kempinski hotel has simply “losed” in the requirements of Arab customers.
“Shaming to you,” says in another post, pointing out that the hotel, which is located in Kurfurstendamm, is close to a synagogue.
Spiegel quickly dismissed any accusations by calling the incident “overlook” and “apologing to Lanzman.”
“Never a direct order has ever been issued” not to include Israel in the list of codes for calls, Suddeutsche Zeitung is quoted as quoted by Kempinski.
It adds that the calling code has been added to the list.
